# Copy to `.env` (same folder) and fill in. `.env` is gitignored.
#
# To enable historical usage data from Anthropic's Admin API:
#
# 1. Visit https://console.anthropic.com/settings/admin-keys
# 2. Click "Create admin API key" (org owner only — admin keys are separate
#    from regular API keys and have organization-level scope).
# 3. Copy the key. Paste below.
# 4. Save this file as `.env` (not .env.example).
# 5. Restart the dashboard: `Stop-Process -Name node -Force; node server.js`
#
# Without this, the dashboard only shows usage from local jsonl files
# (typically the last few days of activity).

ANTHROPIC_ADMIN_API_KEY=

# Optional: override the dashboard port (default 4321)
# PORT=4321
